{"id":"41e0916157977176","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset.md","title":"ZFC Countably Closed Poset","display":"df-zfc-countably-closed-poset — ZFC Countably Closed Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-countably-closed-poset — ZFC Countably Closed Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-countably-closed-poset — ZFC Countably Closed Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountablyClosedPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CountablyClosedPoset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountablyClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall\\vec p\\in P^\\omega\\;\\bigl((\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle \\vec p(n+1),\\vec p(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to\\exists q\\in P\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle q,\\vec p(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountablyClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall\\vec p\\in P^\\omega\\;\\bigl((\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle \\vec p(n+1),\\vec p(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to\\exists q\\in P\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle q,\\vec p(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure is order-theoretic and now depends only on the actual poset predicate; the unrelated generic <code>closed</code> dependency was removed.</li>\n<li>The unary predicate now unpacks its own poset datum, and every comparison uses membership in the supplied order relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountablyClosedPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountablyClosedPoset}_S(\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\exists P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathbb P=\\langle P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\land\\forall\\vec p\\in P^\\omega\\;\\bigl((\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle \\vec p(n+1),\\vec p(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P}))\\to\\exists q\\in P\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle q,\\vec p(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1305,"backlinks":[{"id":"cde6e4a8d34c3e10","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CountablyClosedPoset}_S$ (countably-closed-poset predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1782","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset.md|58-df-zfc-countably-closed-poset]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}